evidence.text:
The project will support: (i) the development of a digitally enabled classroom assessment system
to capture age-appropriate milestones for literacy (such as letter name and sound knowledge, vocabulary, oral reading
fluency and comprehension) and numeracy development for different stages of primary education;

extra_evidence.text:
Enhancements will include: (i) tracking of
student learning outcomes data collected through periodic formative assessments, annual summative assessments, and
other state level assessments;

aec_rows.sentence:
The project will support: (i) the development of a digitally enabled classroom assessment system
to capture age-appropriate milestones for literacy (such as letter name and sound knowledge, vocabulary, oral reading
fluency and comprehension) and numeracy development for different stages of primary education;

Enhancements will include: (i) tracking of
student learning outcomes data collected through periodic formative assessments, annual summative assessments, and
other state level assessments;

exclusion_log.sentence:
For adolescents aged 15-19, the project will pilot interventions linked to: (i) providing
remediation support through bridge programs related to second chance education, including open schooling for
elementary and above;
